        "TileImage": "$($repository 6bba3888-28ea-4d3f-8056-6f042a7368b1).Image",
        "Description": "After obtaining the contract list and returning to the present, Mr. Hopperson sent a coded message through the newspaper. Your mission is to attend the filming set for the newest Dino Boscoe Movie, where 4 members of the hit list currently overlap. You must not disguise yourself under any circumstances. It&apos;s imperative they know who&apos;s coming for them. Today, we are doing it loud.",
